<title>JAPAN: Hitachi Construction - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hitachi Construction - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		131.84		vs	  121.89</p>
<p> Operating	    6.48		vs	    1.66</p>
<p> Current		3.66		vs	  458    million</p>
<p> Net		    1.61		vs	  358    million</p>
<p> EPS		   11.22 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    144 million	  vs	 144 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hitachi Construction Machinery Co Ltd is a major maker of hydraulic shovels.</p>
</text>
